Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 06:49:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): every False exit names its cause in
 gateway-exit-diag.log [daveey]

gateway.exit_nonzero was bare ({}) for every False start_gateway() return except a stop signal or a
refused start, so a new cause (mini, 10-29 22:01 PT) looked like the already-fixed one and the reason
lived only in gateway.log. Each exit site now calls note_exit_cause(cause, reason) (first note wins);
the record carries cause + exit_reason, or cause=unrecorded when a site noted none. An AST guard test
fails on any return False on the exit path without a note. Exit codes are unchanged.

Defect gateway-3cf2256311, card t_01a18b6ce90c450d.
